Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:34.04,Brand,,0,0,0,,CHỊ ƠI, ĐẾN RỒI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:34.04,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)}Mẹ gõ cửa xe giữa đêm Noel:\N"Nói chưa con?"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:34.04,End,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}Xem trọn phim trên kênh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.12,0:00:02.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Đông! Nói chưa con?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.36,0:00:05.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mẹ đi về đi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.22,0:00:09.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Con bé đây à? Cháu tên gì?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.39,0:00:12.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dạ, cháu tên Hạ.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.67,0:00:18.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hai năm! Nó tên Hạ!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.38,0:00:20.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Đôi găng đưa chưa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.68,0:00:23.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mẹ!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:29.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nó lái đêm giống bố nó. Cháu\Nnhắc nó mặc thêm áo.
